itle":"Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-mahimā"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":70,"first_line":"‘dayāl nitāi chaitanya’ ba’le","author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"},"title":["Dayāl Nitāi Chaitanya"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["‘dayāl nitāi chaitanya’ ba’le nāch re āmār mana","nāch re āmār mana, nāch re āmār mana"],"translation":["O my mind, dance! O my mind, dance! O my mind, dance, chanting, “Dayāl Nitāi Chaitanya!”"],"isLong":false},{"text":["(eman dayāl ta’ nāi he mār kheye prema dey)"],"translation":["Oh! No one is so merciful! Nitāi endures being beaten yet gives His aggressors divine love."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["(ore) aparādha dūre yābe, pābe prema-dhan","    (aparādhera vichāra to nāi he)","(takhan) kṛṣṇa-nāme ruchi habe, ghuchibe bandhana","    (anurāg to habe he)"],"translation":["Then my offences will go away and I will attain the wealth of divine love. (In the Names of Nitāi and Chaitanya, there is no consideration of offences.) Then I will develop taste for Kṛṣṇa’s Name and my bondage will be destroyed. (Then I will have loving attachment.)"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["(takhan) anāyāse saphal habe jīvera jīvana","    (naile jīvan to michhe he)","    (kṛṣṇa-rati vinā jīver jīvan to michhe he)","(śeṣe) vṛndāvane rādhā-śyāmer pābe daraśana","    (gaura-kṛpā hale he)"],"translation":["Then easily the life of the soul will be successful. (Without attachment to Kṛṣṇa, a soul’s life is simply false.) Then, at the end of life, a soul will see Śrī Śrī Rādhā-Śyām in Vṛndāvan (if Śrī Gaura bestows His mercy)."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/doyal-nitai-chaitanya-bole","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-doi-al-nitai","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":fals